2026-10-27 01:00:50+07:00 [INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:3173] 2026-10-26 18:00:50,482 >> So, the expression inside the square root is |a|² + |b|² + 2|a||b|cosθ. Since |a| is 3 and |b| is 14, let's plug those numbers in. That becomes 3² + 14² + 2*3*14*cosθ. Which simplifies to 9 + 196 + 84 cosθ, so 205 + 84 cosθ.
