2026-10-27 01:00:50+07:00 [INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:3173] 2026-10-26 18:00:50,482 >> Well, the cosine of θ ranges from -1 to 1. So, the minimum value of cosθ is -1, and the maximum is 1. So, if I plug cosθ = -1 into the expression, 205 + 84*(-1) = 205 - 84 = 121. So the expression inside the square root becomes 121, and the square root of 121 is 11. So, the minimal value is 11.
