2026-10-27 01:02:58+07:00 [INFO|base_episode_generator.py:177:3173] 2026-10-26 18:02:58,110 >> Okay, so I have this problem here about a club with 20 members, 12 boys and 8 girls. I need to find the probability that when two people are chosen at random, one is a boy and the other is a girl. Hmm, okay. Let me think about how to approach this.
