2026-10-27 01:02:58+07:00 [INFO|base_episode_generator.py:177:3173] 2026-10-26 18:02:58,110 >> So, let's calculate that. (12/20)*(8/19) + (8/20)*(12/19) = [ (12*8) + (8*12) ] / (20*19) = (96 + 96)`
